{"unit_id":"rocketstar666__dsh-approval-comment#card-zh","repo":"rocketstar666/dsh-approval-comment","commit":"89c62c2f20bec3a1ab082b92ba2f8aadcb5807f8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-approval-comment 是面向 DSH Web 的审批面板增强插件，在原有审批界面中提供可选附言输入，并由宿主端接管审批结果处理。用户可以允许一次或拒绝请求，也可以附上说明；说明会先尝试作为当前回合的引导消息发送，发送失败时改为排队。普通拒绝会结束当前回合，带说明的拒绝则让模型读取意见后调整并继续；允许并附言时，后续一次审批可免于再次提示。适合希望在审批时补充指令、并控制拒绝后工作流的 DSH Web 用户。安装使用 Web profile，无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:130-177","lib/index.js:43-115"]}
{"unit_id":"rocketstar666__dsh-approval-comment#card-en","repo":"rocketstar666/dsh-approval-comment","commit":"89c62c2f20bec3a1ab082b92ba2f8aadcb5807f8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-approval-comment adds a note field to the DSH Web approval panel. Notes are steered into the current turn or queued if needed. Plain rejection ends the turn; rejection with a note lets the model adjust and continue. It needs no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:130-177","lib/index.js:43-115"]}
