{"unit_id":"rocketstar666__dsh-approval-comment#feature-1","repo":"rocketstar666/dsh-approval-comment","commit":"89c62c2f20bec3a1ab082b92ba2f8aadcb5807f8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-approval-comment 的功能「审批附言」：审批卡片提供可选文本框，提交允许或拒绝决定时，会将附言尝试作为当前回合的引导消息发送；无法引导时会改为排队发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:144-192"]}
{"unit_id":"rocketstar666__dsh-approval-comment#feature-2","repo":"rocketstar666/dsh-approval-comment","commit":"89c62c2f20bec3a1ab082b92ba2f8aadcb5807f8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-approval-comment 的功能「拒绝后的回合控制」：宿主端记录拒绝结果；无附言时拒绝后续步骤并结束当前回合，有附言时让模型处理意见后继续，并清理回合边界上的临时状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:81-115"]}
